  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_8098.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(19 fotos) Desde la ma&ntilde;ana de este lunes al viernes 1 de abril, se puede visitar en El Carmen de Onda el Museo M&oacute;vil (MUMO), gracias a una iniciativa conjunta de la Caja Rural y el Museo de Ciencias Naturales.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/MUMO28març1abril.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 680px;\" /></p>\n<p>El cami&oacute;n-contenedor, abierto en principio de 10 a 14 y de 16 a 19 horas, con entrada gratuita, presenta pintura, escultura, instalaciones, fotograf&iacute;a o video.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8062.jpg\" alt=\"img_8062\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8063.jpg\" alt=\"img_8063\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8064.jpg\" alt=\"img_8064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8065.jpg\" alt=\"img_8065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8066.jpg\" alt=\"img_8066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8069.jpg\" alt=\"img_8069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8070.jpg\" alt=\"img_8070\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8072.jpg\" alt=\"img_8072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8073.jpg\" alt=\"img_8073\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8075.jpg\" alt=\"img_8075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8083.jpg\" alt=\"img_8083\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8090.jpg\" alt=\"img_8090\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8091.jpg\" alt=\"img_8091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8092.jpg\" alt=\"img_8092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8093.jpg\" alt=\"img_8093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8094.jpg\" alt=\"img_8094\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8096.jpg\" alt=\"img_8096\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8097.jpg\" alt=\"img_8097\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/img_8098.jpg\" alt=\"img_8098\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mumomuseuelcarmeonda/mumo28marc1abril.jpg\" alt=\"mumo28marc1abril\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
